      "contentHtml": "</p> <p> <audio controls preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/011111100012.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> １．<div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai5_bk_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>わたしは <ruby>京都<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Tôi đi Kyoto.</span></div></div></div></p> <p> ２．<div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai5_bk_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>わたしは タクシーで うちへ <ruby>帰<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Tôi về nhà bằng taxi.</div></div></div></p> <p> ３．<div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai5_bk_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>わたしは </span><span><ruby>家族<rp>(</rp><rt>かぞく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></span><span>と <ruby>日本<rp>(</rp><rt>にほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ました。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Tôi đến Nhật cùng gia đ&igrave;nh.</div></div></div></p> <p> </div>",
