      "id": "tab3",
      "title": "Đọc 例文(れいぶん) (ví dụ)",
      "titleHtml": "Đọc <span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><ruby>例文<rp>(</rp><rt>れいぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></span> (ví dụ)",
      "contentHtml": "</p> <p> <audio controls preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/011111100102.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> <span>１．</span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai5_rb_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>あした どこへ <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きますか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Ngày mai anh/chị đi đâu?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> &hellip; <ruby>奈良<rp>(</rp><rt>なら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Tôi đi Nara.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span>２．</span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai5_rb_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>日曜日<rp>(</rp><rt>にちようび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> どこへ <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きましたか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Chủ nhật anh/chị đã đi đâu?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> &hellip; どこ「へ」も<ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きませんでした。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Tôi không đi đâu cả.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span>３．</span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai5_rb_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で <ruby>東京<rp>(</rp><rt>とうきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きますか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Anh/chị đi Tokyo bằng phương tiện g&igrave;?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> &hellip; <ruby>新幹線<rp>(</rp><rt>しんかんせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Tôi đi bằng Shinkansen.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span>４．</span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai5_rb_4.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>だれと <ruby>東京<rp>(</rp><rt>とうきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きますか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Anh/chị đi Tokyo cùng với ai?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> &hellip; <ruby>山田<rp>(</rp><rt>やまだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんと <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Tôi đi cùng với ông/bà Yamada.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span>５．</span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai5_rb_5.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>いつ <ruby>日本<rp>(</rp><rt>にほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ましたか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Anh/chị đến Nhật bao giờ?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> &hellip; ３<ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>がつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>２５<ruby>日<rp>(</rp><rt>にち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ました。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Tôi đến vào ngày 25 tháng 3.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span>６．</span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai5_rb_6.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>誕生日<rp>(</rp><rt>たんじょうび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は いつですか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Sinh nhật của anh/chị là ngày nào?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> &hellip;６<ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>がつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>１３<ruby>日<rp>(</rp><rt>にち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Ngày 13 tháng 6.</div></div></div></p> <p> </div>",
